1523:Middlewares/FreeRTOS/Source/tasks.c ****          * been assigned a priority above the configured maximum system call
1524:Middlewares/FreeRTOS/Source/tasks.c ****          * priority.  Only FreeRTOS functions that end in FromISR can be called
1525:Middlewares/FreeRTOS/Source/tasks.c ****          * from interrupts  that have been assigned a priority at or (logically)
1526:Middlewares/FreeRTOS/Source/tasks.c ****          * below the maximum system call interrupt priority.  FreeRTOS maintains a
1527:Middlewares/FreeRTOS/Source/tasks.c ****          * separate interrupt safe API to ensure interrupt entry is as fast and as
